@NODE MAIN "FriendSh3ep - Mastodon client for AmigaOS3"

@{b}FriendSh3ep v1.0@{ub}
A Mastodon / Fediverse client for AmigaOS 3.2.x (68k)

@{i}Toots, timelines, images and emoji -- the Fediverse, Amiga style.@{ui}

@IMAGE PROGDIR:friendsh3ep_app.iff

